# Required for direct Cursor SDK runs and Cursor judge/user-simulator classifiers.
# Export into the shell (e.g. `export CURSOR_API_KEY=...`); agent-test does not auto-load this file.
#   api-key      -> CURSOR_API_KEY below (metered API billing). Default when the key is set.
#   subscription -> Cursor.auth.login() store at ~/.cursor/sdk/auth.json
# The Cursor app login does not count. Run Cursor.auth.login() once, or set a key.
# CURSOR_AUTH_MODE=
CURSOR_API_KEY=

# Required for direct Claude Code runs (--host claude): choose one auth mode explicitly.
#   api-key      -> ANTHROPIC_API_KEY below (metered API billing)
#   subscription -> Claude Code CLI login (keychain OAuth or CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN)
# CLAUDE_AUTH_MODE=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional Claude Code overrides:
# CLAUDE_CODE_BIN=
# CLAUDE_AGENT_MODEL=
# CLAUDE_CODE_ALLOWED_TOOLS=Bash,Read,Edit,Write,Glob,Grep,Agent

# Required for direct OpenAI Codex runs (--host openai) and OpenAI judge/user-simulator.
#   api-key      -> OPENAI_API_KEY or CODEX_API_KEY (metered API billing). Default when a key is set.
#   subscription -> `codex login` ChatGPT session. Strips stale API keys from the child env.
# OPENAI_AUTH_MODE=
# CODEX_BIN=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# CODEX_API_KEY=
# Optional Codex model. Unset uses the CLI default. User ~/.codex/config.toml is ignored.
# CODEX_AGENT_MODEL=

# Optional agent-test knobs (see packages/test/README.md)
# AGENT_TEST_DEBUG=1
# AGENT_TEST_VERBOSE=1
# AGENT_TEST_VERBOSE_PATHS=1
# AGENT_TEST_HOST_LOGS=1
# AGENT_TEST_NO_REPORT_PREVIEW=1
# AGENT_TEST_QUIET=1
# AGENT_TEST_TIMEOUT_MS=600000
# AGENT_TEST_ALLOW_IN_PLACE=1
# AGENT_TEST_NO_WORKTREE=1
# AGENT_TEST_NO_ISOLATE=1
# AGENT_TEST_SCENARIO_SETTLE_MS=0
# AGENT_TEST_LIVE_RETRIES=3
# AGENT_TEST_SCENARIO_RETRIES=1
# CURSOR_AGENT_MODEL=
# CURSOR_JUDGE_MODEL=
# CURSOR_JUDGE_TEMPERATURE=
